          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: The witness observes, in the southern suburb of Paris, an orange glowing ball flying at low altitude towards Paris. The description and movement according to the south wind (see weather report) are in every way consistent with the appearance of a Thai lantern. This holiday season is conducive to the release of these lanterns. The GEIPAN classifies this case as a \"B\": probable Thai lantern.",
